<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/21/msa@/~cl_31> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 30 dengan seksyen yang berikut: “Redirection of letters 30. Where a debtor has been adjudged bankrupt, the court, on the application of the Director General of Insolvency, may order that for a period not exceeding three months letters posted to the bankrupt at any place mentioned in the order for redirection be redirected, sent or delivered by the postal authorities to the Director General of Insolvency or otherwise as the court directs, and the same shall be done accordingly.”. Pindaan seksyen 31"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/21/msa@> .
